0,Oroqen people - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Oroqen_people,The Oroqen or Orochen people (Oroqen: ɔrɔtʃeen; simplified Chinese: 鄂伦春族; traditional Chinese: 鄂倫春族; pinyin: Èlúnchūnzú; Mongolian: Orčun) are a Tungusic ethnic group native to Siberia and northern China.,Oroqen,Tungusic
